        "version_b": {
          "content": "合作、创新、协同、赋能 (Cooperation, Innovation, Synergy, Empowerment)",
          "source_files": ["raw_data/values_summary_v2.json"]
        },
        "resolution_reasoning": "Version A (with 共赢/Win-win) is preferred because: (1) It appears in the primary company_overview.txt document; (2) 'Win-win' is more consistent with the collaborative ethos described throughout company documentation; (3) 'Innovation' as a value is not emphasized elsewhere in the documentation, while win-win collaboration is mentioned repeatedly. However, this is a close call and the values_summary_v2.json is dated more recently (2024-09-01 vs 2024-08-15).",
