        "raw_data/meeting_notes_q3.md"
      ],
      "conflict_status": "no_conflict",
      "notes": "The qi_liang_yi_cai_project.yaml provides comprehensive documentation of all seven phases. team_collaboration.md provides high-level introduction and connection to systems thinking. meeting_notes_q3.md confirms ongoing use of the methodology."
    }
